BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 195.0 673.0 Td ('Hi, I'm Jezreal Momoh, a Backend AI Engineer based in Ilorin, Nigeria. This is my live portfolio. The hero section makes my core proof statement clear in five seconds: I build Go and Python services, APIs, and model integrations with rigorous testing. Notice the direct actions: download my verified engineering CV or jump straight to selected work.') Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 440.0 673.0 Td (Proves core claim in <5s; clean editorial hierarchy) Tj ET
q 0.97 0.97 0.97 rg 46.0 659.5 520.0 11.0 re f Q
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 662.0 Td (0:45-1:45) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 100.0 662.0 Td (Scrolling through #work \(01 to 04\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 195.0 662.0 Td ('Section two shows my four core projects: Themis \(multi-agent security reviewer using LangGraph\), LLM Enrichment API \(FastAPI with strict Pydantic schemas and 8/8 evals\), GemmaRoute \(dynamic model routing\), and The Polite Scraper. Every single project card links directly to public GitHub source code and architectural documentation.') Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 440.0 662.0 Td (Proves real work, GitHub source code, no placeholders) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 651.0 Td (1:45-3:00) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 100.0 651.0 Td (Interactive contact form testing) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 195.0 651.0 Td ('Now, let's look at the one dynamic feature: the contact form. This isn't a static mailto link. It connects to Netlify's edge form handler. Watch what happens when I type spaces and hit send: client-side validation catches it immediately. When I fill in real details and submit, the button disables to prevent double-submits, an AbortController enforces a 12-second timeout, and a success confirmation appears without reloading.') Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 440.0 651.0 Td (Demonstrates dynamic feature working + error handling) Tj ET
q 0.97 0.97 0.97 rg 46.0 637.5 520.0 11.0 re f Q
