BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 195.0 640.0 Td ('In the footer, you can see the official FlyRank Graduate Badge. Clicking Verify opens my live credential record FR-D11-556C8-0CB4D. Here in the source code, you can see privacy-first analytics from Cloudflare and GoatCounter - zero cookies, zero banners, 100% respecting visitor privacy.') Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 440.0 640.0 Td (Proves graduate badge integration & credential link) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 50.0 629.0 Td (3:45-4:30) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 100.0 629.0 Td (Runbook & Calendar Reminder) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 195.0 629.0 Td ('Finally, to keep this platform compounding, I don't start from scratch for future projects. I have an active iCalendar reminder set for the 27th of every month, a 10-minute three-beat case study template, and my preserved Claude Project holding my voice card and design tokens. My next case study - an enterprise LLM metering engine - is already scheduled.') Tj ET
BT /F1 7.2 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 440.0 629.0 Td (Proves compounding habit and preserved AI context) Tj ET
